+# DOCUMENT INTERACTION FIX — PASS
+
+**Date:** 2026-09-19  
+**Scope:** `extra_photo` and `kinder_note` only.
+
+## ROOT CAUSE
+
+### extra_photo
+
+- `aptShift(s, n)` adds `doc_extra_photo` when the apartment is visited for the second time (`n >= 2`) and `s.shifted.child` is not set.
+- The photograph appears in the child's room alongside the existing chair/toy-box and memory-light changes. Its existing label is «صورة لم تكن هنا».
+- Call chain: `enterScene` → apartment `shiftFn` / `aptShift` → `addInt({type:'doc', doc:'extra_photo'})` → `updateHint` / focus → E → `doInteract` → document handler → `openDoc('extra_photo')`.
+- `DOCS.extra_photo` did not exist. `openDoc` returned immediately, while the document handler still set `used=true` and incremented the document statistic. Nothing opened or entered the notebook.
+
+### kinder_note
+
+- `buildKinder()` places `doc_kinder_note` at `(3.4, 3.4)`, in the kindergarten kitchen. Its existing label is «ملاحظة المعلّمة».
+- The existing location includes toys, cots and a music box in the playroom. The teacher's note has no puzzle reward or `onTake` callback.
+- Call chain: `buildKinder` → `addInt({type:'doc', doc:'kinder_note'})` → `updateHint` / focus → E → `doInteract` → document handler → `openDoc('kinder_note')`.
+- `DOCS.kinder_note` did not exist, producing the same silent failure and consumed interaction.
+
+## SEARCH / RECOVERY
+
+Before editing, the current project, **92 text files in the ZIP**, `_dev` backups, patch scripts, source tests, historical generated test files, design notes and the **two available Git commits** were searched. Each archive/history search found 82 matching reference lines, but no document content definitions. Related phrases such as “teacher”, “fifth”, “صورة خامسة” and “ملاحظة المعلّمة” were also checked.
+
+No prior text was recoverable. The definitions below are **minimal replacements**, not claimed to be recovered original writing. They follow the existing English `kind` / `title` / `body` document format and introduce no names, dates, codes, project revelations or puzzle changes.
+
+Search evidence: `document-fix-evidence/archive-search.txt`, `context-search.txt`, `git-search.txt`.
+
+## FIX
+
+### extra_photo
+
+Added only `DOCS.extra_photo`:
+
+```text
+Kind: PHOTOGRAPH
+Title: Another photograph
+
+A photograph of this room.
+A chair. A toy box.
+
+You do not remember this photograph being here
+when you first came in.
+```
+
+The text reflects the existing room and revisit anomaly without explaining it.
+
+### kinder_note
+
+Added only `DOCS.kinder_note`:
+
+```text
+Kind: HANDWRITTEN NOTE
+Title: Teacher's note
+
+A note left by a teacher:
+
+   "Please put the toys back after playtime.
+    Leave the music box in the playroom."
+
+The room is quiet now.
+```
+
+The text is an ordinary teacher's reminder about objects already in the kindergarten. It adds no clue or reward.
+
+## FILES CHANGED — THIS REQUEST ONLY
+
+### Existing game file
+
+- `chernobyl/index.html`: **13 inserted lines**, defining the two missing entries at the start of `DOCS`.
+
+An exact comparison against the start-of-request file verifies that removing this insertion restores the entire original file byte-for-byte. No camera, player, AI, puzzle, save/load, rendering, interaction-handler or other story code changed.
+
+### New verification files
+
+- `chernobyl/tests/documents.js`: targeted browser regression for these two documents.
+- `DOCUMENTS-FIX-REPORT.md`: this report.
+- `document-fix-evidence/`: before/after results, search logs, test output, minimal diff and two screenshots.
+
+**All pre-existing test files and all other existing game files are unchanged.** The older `STABILITY-CHECK.md` and `stability-evidence/` remain historical records and were not rewritten; this report records the resolution of their two open document-reference failures.
+
+## TEST RESULTS
+
+Tests were actually executed against the final source using Chromium 153 / WebGL SwiftShader and the local Three.js library. No original test assertion was edited or removed.
+
+| Test execution | PASS | FAIL |
+|---|---:|---:|
+| Original/current Node suites, including `t_stability.js` and `t_static.js` | 20/20 suites | 0 |
+| Same Node suites with real Three.js (renderer stub only) | 20/20 suites | 0 |
