+| New `chernobyl/tests/documents.js` | 19/19 checks | 0 |
+| Existing expanded `chernobyl/tests/stability.js` | **104/104 checks** | **0** |
+
+### Why 104 rather than 102?
+
+The previous result was **102 PASS + 2 FAIL = 104 checks**. The same, unchanged expanded test now reports **104 PASS + 0 FAIL**. Comparison by check name verifies that all previous **102/102 successful checks remain successful**, and the two formerly failing reference checks now pass.
+
+### Direct proof for both documents
+
+The new targeted test was first run before the definitions were inserted:
+
+- Before: **5 PASS / 14 FAIL**. Both interactables were reachable and consumed by E, but no document viewer opened and nothing entered the notebook.
+- After: **19 PASS / 0 FAIL**.
