+5. Collection recorded exactly once in inventory/notebook and the interaction marked used.
+6. Notebook entry is visible.
+7. Clicking the notebook entry reopens the same text without adding duplicates.
+8. Collection survives Save → page reload → Continue.
+9. The document is still readable from the notebook after reload.
+
+The expanded suite also completed its existing assisted Part 1 route to `ORIGINAL`. It remains an automated accelerated test, not a new claim of an uninterrupted manual playthrough.
