+- No `InstancedMesh` system was introduced: this small selected set retains individual existing prop roots/culling, and measured submissions already decreased.
+- New props use the existing render-anchor convention `(sp.x + 0.5, 0, sp.y + 0.5)`. Logical positions are never written.
+- Geometry bottoms are normalized to ground height. The selector rejects obstructing tile footprints without moving anchors. Existing flat rubble is allowed beneath props, including the crash shell's own rubble tile.
